---
// NarrativeStrataSection
---

<section class="narrative-section" id="narrative" data-section="02 // STRATA">
  <div class="grid-container">
    {/* Section Header */}
    <div class="narrative-header-col reveal-on-scroll">
      <div class="eyebrow-badge">
        <span class="beacon-dot"></span>
        <span data-scramble="02 // RESEARCH DISCIPLINE">02 // RESEARCH DISCIPLINE</span>
      </div>

      <h2 class="section-title">
        From Fragmented Signal <br />
        <span class="text-emerald">To Defensible Truth.</span>
      </h2>

      <p class="section-subtitle">
        Most corporate decisions and security investigations operate on incomplete or polluted data. 
        Agletras applies a deterministic pipeline that isolates verified facts from speculative assumptions.
      </p>
    </div>

    {/* Strata 1: Data Ingestion */}
    <div class="strata-col panel-telemetry reveal-on-scroll reveal-delay-1">
      <div class="strata-meta font-mono text-xs text-muted">
        <span>PHASE: 01_INGESTION</span>
        <span class="text-emerald font-bold">RATE_CONTROLLED</span>
      </div>

      <div class="strata-number font-mono">01</div>
      <h3 class="strata-title font-display">Passive Multilateral Ingestion</h3>
      <p class="strata-desc text-body">
        We passively observe official government gazettes, corporate registrar filings, Certificate Transparency streams, and historical DNS logs. We never touch private networks or violate platform boundaries.
      </p>

      <div class="strata-indicators font-mono text-xs">
        <span class="indicator-tag">CT LOG STREAM</span>
        <span class="indicator-tag">PASSIVE DNS</span>
        <span class="indicator-tag">REGISTRY SCRAPING</span>
      </div>

      <div class="strata-assurance font-mono text-xs">
        <span class="text-muted">OPERATIONAL DISCIPLINE:</span>
        <span class="text-emerald font-semibold">100% Lawful Public Domain Records</span>
      </div>
    </div>

    {/* Strata 2: Relational Graphing */}
    <div class="strata-col panel-telemetry reveal-on-scroll reveal-delay-2">
      <div class="strata-meta font-mono text-xs text-muted">
        <span>PHASE: 02_CORRELATION</span>
        <span class="text-emerald font-bold">TOPOLOGICAL_GRAPH</span>
      </div>

      <div class="strata-number font-mono">02</div>
      <h3 class="strata-title font-display">Relational Resolution & Graphing</h3>
      <p class="strata-desc text-body">
        Disparate records are normalized through phonetic algorithms and entity-resolution models, linking corporate officers, offshore shells, lookalike domains, and server subnets into cohesive topologies.
      </p>

      <div class="strata-indicators font-mono text-xs">
        <span class="indicator-tag">ENTITY RESOLUTION</span>
        <span class="indicator-tag">BGP CORRELATION</span>
        <span class="indicator-tag">CROSS-HOLDINGS</span>
      </div>

      <div class="strata-assurance font-mono text-xs">
        <span class="text-muted">OPERATIONAL DISCIPLINE:</span>
        <span class="text-emerald font-semibold">Multi-Jurisdictional Entity Linkage</span>
      </div>
    </div>

    {/* Strata 3: Human Verification */}
    <div class="strata-col panel-telemetry reveal-on-scroll reveal-delay-3">
      <div class="strata-meta font-mono text-xs text-muted">
        <span>PHASE: 03_SYNTHESIS</span>
        <span class="text-emerald font-bold">HUMAN_GOVERNED</span>
      </div>

      <div class="strata-number font-mono">03</div>
      <h3 class="strata-title font-display">Human Epistemic Synthesis</h3>
      <p class="strata-desc text-body">
        AI accelerates discovery, but senior intelligence specialists evaluate competing hypotheses (ACH), challenge false positives, and classify every observation with transparent confidence scores.
      </p>

      <div class="strata-indicators font-mono text-xs">
        <span class="indicator-tag">ACH METHODOLOGY</span>
        <span class="indicator-tag">PEER-REVIEWED</span>
        <span class="indicator-tag">ATTRIBUTED FACTS</span>
      </div>

      <div class="strata-assurance font-mono text-xs">
        <span class="text-muted">OPERATIONAL DISCIPLINE:</span>
        <span class="text-emerald font-semibold">Zero Unattributed Inferences</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .narrative-section {
    padding-top: 130px;
    padding-bottom: 130px;
    position: relative;
    background-color: var(--bg-deep);
    border-top: 1px solid var(--border-hairline);
  }

  .narrative-header-col {
    grid-column: span 32;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 20px;
    margin-bottom: 64px;
  }

  .strata-col {
    grid-column: span 10;
    padding: 44px 36px;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 22px;
    min-height: 440px;
    background: var(--bg-surface);
    border: 1px solid var(--border-hairline);
    transition: transform var(--transition-normal), border-color var(--transition-normal), box-shadow var(--transition-normal);
  }

  .strata-col:last-child {
    grid-column: span 12;
  }

  .strata-col:hover {
    transform: translateY(-4px);
    border-color: rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.45);
    box-shadow: 0 12px 32px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.45);
  }

  .strata-meta {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: center;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-hairline);
    padding-bottom: 14px;
  }

  .strata-number {
    font-size: 2.8rem;
    font-weight: 800;
    line-height: 1;
    color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.12);
  }

  .strata-title {
    font-size: 1.55rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--text-primary);
    line-height: 1.25;
  }

  .strata-desc {
    flex-grow: 1;
  }

  .strata-indicators {
    display: flex;
    gap: 8px;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    padding-top: 16px;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--border-hairline);
  }

  .indicator-tag {
    padding: 4px 8px;
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03);
    border: 1px solid var(--border-hairline);
    color: var(--text-muted);
    border-radius: 2px;
    font-size: 10px;
    letter-spacing: 0.06em;
  }

  .strata-assurance {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 4px;
    padding-top: 14px;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--border-hairline);
  }

  .text-emerald {
    color: var(--brand-green-bright);
  }

  @media (max-width: 1280px) {
    .strata-col, .strata-col:last-child {
      grid-column: span 16;
      min-height: 400px;
    }
  }

  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .narrative-header-col {
      grid-column: span 8;
      margin-bottom: 40px;
    }
    .strata-col, .strata-col:last-child {
      grid-column: span 8;
      padding: 28px 24px;
      min-height: auto;
    }
  }

  @media (max-width: 480px) {
    .narrative-header-col {
      grid-column: span 4;
    }
    .strata-col, .strata-col:last-child {
      grid-column: span 4;
    }
  }
</style>
